      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……なんか、思い出してさ\r\nあの時の樹里は……そうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょうど今みたいに\r\n日の光で髪がキラキラしててさ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ！？\r\n……キ、キラキラって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、この街の景色の中でもひときわ輝いてて……\r\nだけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──や、やめろよな！\r\nだから、輝いてるとか、そういうの……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\n本当のことだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "っあー……もーいいよ……！\r\nはぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……それに、あの頃──アンタに会う前は\r\nほんとに、そんなんじゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──……なぁ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシは……あの時、どっかの物好きなプロデューサーに\r\nここで人生を変えられたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……大きいステージからの景色とか、たくさんのファン、\r\nそれに……新しい仲間……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──ほんと、\r\n自分じゃ思ってもみなかったことだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……けどさ、アンタ的にはどうなんだよ\r\n今のアタシは、あの時から変わって見えるか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100201/1011002010100"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……樹里らしさってことでいうなら──\r\nきっと変わってないと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも樹里は、出会った時の樹里のまま……\r\n一生懸命成長して、ずっとアイドルとして立っているんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう意味では、変わり続けてるんだと思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011002010110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……おー、そっか",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
